      "parameters": {
        "content": "### If something goes wrong\n- **An Apify run fails** (bad input, timeout, cost cap reached): the node retries once, then the execution stops before any row or draft is created. Run it again; nothing was half-done.\n- **No new companies today:** the workflow ends after \"New companies with a website\" (no extractor cost, no rows, no drafts).\n- **Duplicates:** every company is matched by website domain against the Leads tab before anything is written, so a repeated run never adds a company or a draft twice. Delete a row to let that company come back.\n- For the 6 AM schedule, set an error workflow in **Workflow settings** to get notified.",
